lk around looking for even more &quot;problems&quot; to create even more drama centered around themselves.</p>\n<p>They need to be deported. They're parasites, with all the intent of a parasite to find and nest in a host permanently, then feed off it forever. They shouldn't receive a dime of public money, and no workplace would be improved by their presence.</p>\n<p>They &quot;opted out&quot; of constructively participating in this society. They need to go.</p>"],[4,8703402,8696620,0,0,0,"2017-04-07T21:36:07","unclejimbo","",[],"<p>I mean shit, they want us to house them, feed them, and provide for them they're welcome to go back to being slaves..</p>"],[1,8694722,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T04:42:52","Browngaijin","",[],"<p>I remember when the Respect and Excellence dorms shut down. I wonder what the other ones are named.</p>"],[1,8696081,0,0,0,0,"2017-04-07T07:24:46","Shekelstein6M","",[],"<p>OH NO! That sucks.</p>"],[1,8696107,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T07:28:31","FuckYouReddit-","",[],"<p>/enjoys more popcorn as he watches it burn.....</p>"],[1,8696425,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T08:41:24","fairytisya","",[],"<p>ET go home</p>"],[1,8696478,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T08:52:44","Troll","",[],"<p>Shutting down? That happens when the goyim learns...</p>"],[1,8696693,0,2,0,2,"2017-04-07T09:41:45","Broc_Lia","",[],"<blockquote>\n<p>This is on top of four other dorms that were already scheduled to go “offline” because of plummeting enrollment. Two of them – no joke – are named “Respect” and “Excellence.”</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>The place sounds like something out of those Divergent movies.</p>\n<p>Are they still blaming this on &quot;lack of diversity&quot; I wonder.</p>"],[1,8696752,0,0,0,0,"2017-04-07T09:51:51","acheron2012","",[],"<p>But UC Berkley where terrorist mobs literally try to kill people suffered no repercussions at all. Because people in California are THAT evil. I wish North Korea would drop a nuke on those degenerates. The world would be a better place for it.</p>"],[1,8696831,0,0,0,