[[0,1774746,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T01:03:02","pangaea","",[],"<p>I feel it's a very critical feature in certain situations:</p>\n<p>-Subs which focus on a type of content where someone may want to search for something very specific but not care so much about how recent it is (porn subs for example)</p>\n<p>-Checking if people are talking about you, trying to dox you, etc</p>\n<p>-Finding &quot;that one thing I saw a long time ago&quot;</p>\n<p>-Discovering subs which have content you like or discovering content in subs you may not know about</p>","When will the search function work again?","","voatdev"],[1,8692437,0,2,1,1,"2017-04-07T01:30:55","Sound_Flames","",[],"<p>Yeah I've been curious about this myself</p>"],[1,8693656,0,2,0,2,"2017-04-07T03:11:57","VoatSearch","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://searchvoat.co\">https://searchvoat.co</a></p>"],[2,8694091,8693656,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T03:47:39","pangaea","",[],"<p>It doesn't seem to search the content of discussion posts, only titles. Also good workaround for things I won't do regularly (the middle two scenarios) but a little clunky to have to use another website just to find porn on Voat.</p>"],[3,8694436,8694091,0,0,0,"2017-04-07T04:16:44","VoatSearch","",[],"<p>Will search the body of text submissions (Options -&gt; Search post text) but not comments ... yet.</p>"],[2,8746121,8693656,1,0,1,"2017-04-11T17:30:14","anonOpenPress","",[],"<p>searchvoat is now down too. Do you know something more?</p>"],[3,8747452,8746121,0,0,0,"2017-04-11T19:31:11","VoatSearch","",[],"<p>Yes, I'm sorry, I should have mentioned that <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/whatever/1781209\">I am having some temporary &quot;issues&quot;</a> which I'm working on and should have fixed up soon.</p>"],[4,8828384,8747452,1,0,1,"2017-04-19T05:07:08","Vindicator","",[],"<p>Thank you for your work. You make my life better all the time!</p>"],[1,8828431,0,0,0,0,"2017-04-19T05:15:22","Vindicator","",[],"<p>I would just like to add the voices of the mods at <a href=\"https://voat.co/v/pizzagate\">v/pizzagate</a> to this question, <a href=\"https://voat.co/user/PuttItOut\">@PuttItOut</a>. The missing search function is really feeding the shill narrative that &quot;Voat is compromised&quot; and not a safe and trustworthy place for researchers seeking to expose and bring down the Pedocracy.</p>\n<p>For example, see the comments on these threads:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/v/pizzagate/1802944/8827765\">https://voat.co/v/pizzagate/1802944/8827765</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://voat.co/v/pizzagate/1761414\">https://voat.co/v/pizzagate/1761414</a></p>"]]
[[0,1774747,0,1,0,1,"2017-04-07T01:03:08","1Sorry_SOB","",[],"","How Jewish is the Ivy League?","https://rehmat1.com/2013/05/05/how-jewish-is-the-ivy-league/","JuiceTown"],[1,8692237,0,0,0,0,"2017-04-07T01:12:46","DeerBorneIndependent","",[],"<p>Too Jewish. Far above their population representation. I know Harvard hovers around 20-25%. Meanwhile they restrict white enrollment to 20% despite whites being 65% of the U S population.</p>"]]
